{"availability":"available","full":"Ritik-0102/Vitalis-AI","name":"Vitalis-AI","description":"An intelligent, clinical-grade healthcare chatbot powered by a custom fine-tuned Llama-3 model. Features real-time symptom analysis, multilingual support, an interactive human body map, and a sleek glassmorphism UI. 🧬","category":"Education","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":5,"forks":1,"created":"2026-04-03T13:53:59Z","updated":"2026-09-09T12:00:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://chat-vitalis-ai.vercel.app","topics":["ai-chatbot","firebase","healthcare","javascript","llama-3","machine-learning","medical-assistant","vercel"],"demo":"https://chat-vitalis-ai.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:25.949Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:25.949Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:25.949Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:27:25.949Z","stars":5,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An intelligent, futuristic healthcare assistant powered by a custom fine-tuned Large Language Model (Llama-3).","Vitalis AI is a next-generation, clinical-grade healthcare chatbot designed to democratize access to medical information. Traditional healthcare can often be slow and inaccessible, leaving patients anxious while waiting for basic symptom analysis. Vitalis AI bridges this gap by providing immediate, highly accurate, and empathetic medical insights directly from your browser.","Built with a stunning, responsive glassmorphism UI, the application feels premium, intuitive, and deeply interactive. Under the hood, the brain of Vitalis is powered by a custom fine-tuned Llama-3 (8B) Large Language Model. By specifically training the model on the comprehensive ChatDoctor dataset using cutting-edge Unsloth optimization techniques, Vitalis transcends generic AI responses. It acts as a specialized medical assistant capable of interpreting symptoms, asking dynamic follow-up questions, supporting multiple languages in real-time, and generating personalized daily health tips."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ritik-0102/Vitalis-AI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8b80255cf85528efa28a8e49fd0fbbbccf503224e7df5bda5306f22ad447b4f7","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:26.054Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:26.054Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An intelligent, futuristic healthcare assistant powered by a custom fine-tuned Large Language Model (Llama-3).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ritik-0102/Vitalis-AI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign In: Authenticate securely using the Google Sign-In popup.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ritik-0102/Vitalis-AI/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Onboarding: Enter your Age and Gender upon your first login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ritik-0102/Vitalis-AI/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8b80255cf85528efa28a8e49fd0fbbbccf503224e7df5bda5306f22ad447b4f7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ritik-0102/Vitalis-AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:26.054Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-09T12:00:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ritik-0102/Vitalis-AI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:26.055Z","hash":"8b80255cf85528efa28a8e49fd0fbbbccf503224e7df5bda5306f22ad447b4f7","originalBytes":8633,"storedBytes":8633,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["chat","vercel","session","using","vitalis","custom","model","serverless","api","feature","firebase","google","license","llama-3","neondb","powered","project","dashboard","face","git","healthcare","hugging","medical","past","add","amazingfeature","application","auth","authentication","bash","body","chatdoctor","contributing","core","data","diagnostic","directly","dynamic","environment","fine-tuned","guide","hosted","issues","map","new","postgresql","saves","symptoms","uns